{
"text": "[image: There’s a lot happening across Eastern Washington! Carmela is heading to Walla Walla, Spokane, and Spokane Valley, with two upcoming candidate forums and plenty of opportunities to get involved. Check out this week’s events flyer and find a way to join Team Eastern Washington — whether you’re ready to canvass, phone bank, table, or wave signs! Election Day is getting closer. Let’s finish strong!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeNngmMmLZh/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Valleyfest weekend, sharing a booth with \"Rational Rob\" Tupper, candidate for the 4th LD. We enjoyed lots of good conversations about what people in Spokane Valley need from their representatives. Thanks to everyone who showed up!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeKSC-yiGvk/"
